{"ocrText": "BUFORA JOURNAL\nVolume 6 Number 5 \nJanuary/February 1978\nEditorial Address : 95 Taunton Road, London SE12 8PA\nEditorial\nStrange, isn't it?\nUnless I'm greatly mistaken, the\nGeorgia experience of Tom Dawson\n(see Report-Extra !) will be received,\nspeaking euphemistically, with some\ndegree of scepticism ! Yet what are\nwe prepared to accept or discard ?\nThe AVB case has a fair measure of\nsuppoft amongst researchers generally.\nThat the Flatwood's monster (what-\never it was) existed, whilst not beyond\ndispute, is also usually taken as read.\nM Masse's paralysing encounter with\nthe two bulbous-headed beings in his\nlavender field has almost become a\nclassic. Nearer home in time and\nplace, silver-suited seven-footers either\ndisappearing without trace or addicted\nto Coronation Street on TV are taken\nfor granted!\nBut what of Joe Simonton's pancakes ?\nOr John Womack's anti-demon pill\nswallowing humanoids ? Reference to\nthese and similar cases will bring forth\nhoots of derision. It appears that we\nmay accept intercourse but not nudity-\nFrankenstein monsters but not demons\nand lavender plant collectors but not\npancake (or cookie) distributors ! Or\nis it that at some time or another a\n'top' researcher has lent support to\none and not the other, so that lemming-\nlike, as in many other fields, we accept\nthe judgement of the ' expert ' ?\nThink about it !\nNorman Olioer\nLondon Lectures\nSaturday, 3 February 1978,7 pm: Ley Lines in relation to UFOs.\nSpeaker: Paul Devereux, BA.\nSaturday, 4 March 1978,7 pm: UFO Activity in Scotland.\nSpeaker: Stuart Campbell, Drp. ARcH.\nSaturday, 1 April 1978,7 pm: Research Evening-Anrhony Pace, FRAS.,\nCharles Lockwood, DIp ED. sruo, and selected speakers.\nAll meetings in the lecture theatre of Kensington Central Library, Campden\nHill Road, London \\V8.\nContents\nTrident'Visual UFO'\nIdentified ?\nNew US Probe\nPoints from the Press\nBook Reviews\nA Bell-shaped light at\nRhode-Saint-Genese\nReport-Extra!\nUFO Reports and\nScientific Investigation\nof Rare Phenomena-2\nIJforum\nSighting Summaries\n2\n3\n4\n6\n7\n9\n2t\n23\n25", "textLayer": [{"text": "BUFORA", "x": 23.36, "y": 4.38, "w": 16.37, "h": 3.58, "fontSize": 19.0}, {"text": "JOURNAL", "x": 40.07, "y": 5.11, "w": 16.74, "h": 3.49, "fontSize": 18.5}, {"text": "Volume", "x": 6.75, "y": 8.0, "w": 7.82, "h": 2.07, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "6", "x": 14.8, "y": 7.44, "w": 2.43, "h": 2.83, "fontSize": 15.0}, {"text": "Number", "x": 17.68, "y": 7.99, "w": 8.55, "h": 2.17, "fontSize": 11.5}, {"text": "5", "x": 26.38, "y": 7.51, "w": 2.43, "h": 2.83, "fontSize": 15.0}, {"text": "January/February", "x": 51.98, "y": 8.46, "w": 17.31, "h": 2.07, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "1978", "x": 69.85, "y": 8.6, "w": 3.67, "h": 1.6, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "Editorial", "x": 12.98, "y": 10.06, "w": 9.05, "h": 2.26, "fontSize": 12.0}, {"text": "Address", "x": 22.29, "y": 10.34, "w": 8.03, "h": 1.98, "fontSize": 10.5}, {"text": ":", "x": 30.43, "y": 10.01, "w": 1.4, "h": 2.45, "fontSize": 13.0}, {"text": "95", "x": 31.92, "y": 10.38, "w": 2.83, "h": 1.98, "fontSize": 10.5}, {"text": "Taunton", "x": 34.85, "y": 10.3, "w": 8.42, "h": 2.07, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Road,", "x": 43.65, "y": 10.41, "w": 6.0, "h": 1.98, "fontSize": 10.5}, {"text": "London", "x": 49.93, "y": 10.34, "w": 7.71, "h": 2.07, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "SE12 8PA", "x": 57.98, "y": 10.52, "w": 9.11, "h": 1.92, "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "Editorial", "x": 6.47, "y": 42.69, "w": 13.66, "h": 3.68, "fontSize": 19.5}, {"text": "Strange,", "x": 6.56, "y": 46.09, "w": 8.26, "h": 1.98, "fontSize": 10.5}, {"text": "isn't", "x": 15.22, "y": 45.91, "w": 4.71, "h": 2.26, "fontSize": 12.0}, {"text": "it?", "x": 20.1, "y": 46.05, "w": 2.25, "h": 2.07, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Unless", "x": 6.38, "y": 47.89, "w": 7.43, "h": 2.17, "fontSize": 11.5}, {"text": "I'm", "x": 13.91, "y": 47.6, "w": 4.14, "h": 2.55, "fontSize": 13.5}, {"text": "greatly", "x": 18.8, 